    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Gate Warden Lance",
    "summary": "As the first battle round begins, pick 2 objectives as your foundations and place a round 40 mm foundation marker in each.\n\nIf a line between any point on one foundation marker and any point on the other crosses the base of any model (or its hull, if it has no base), the model's unit counts as on your defensive line.\n\nYour **IMPERIAL KNIGHTS** units on your defensive line have **Against the Horde**:\n\n- You may ignore any or all **Hit roll** modifiers on their models' attacks against **visible** enemy units.\n- Their models' weapons have **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)**.",
